{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Reach out, plan a session, or test a custom blend. Aromatherapy sessions and bespoke blends that may support your daily ease.">
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fbfbfa;--muted:#6b6b6b;--accent:#7aa282;--ink:#222;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);}    
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;color:var(--ink);background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff 0%,#fbfbfa 60%);}    
    .wrap{max-width:1040px;margin:48px auto;padding:28px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--glass);box-shadow:0 6px 30px rgba(18,18,18,0.06),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.5);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);}    
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;margin-bottom:18px}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:64px;height:64px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#a5cfa8);color:white;font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin:0 8px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-size:15px}
    nav a.cta{background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px}
    main{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:start}
    h1{margin:0;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:0.2px}
    p.lead{margin:8px 0 18px;color:var(--muted)}
    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.7),rgba(255,255,255,0.5));padding:18px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(12,12,12,0.05)}
    label{display:block;font-size:13px;margin:10px 0 6px;color:var(--muted)}
    input[type=text],select,textarea,input[type=number]{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6e6e6;background:white;font-size:15px}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    button{background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:10px 14px;border:0;border-radius:10px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
    .flex{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}
    .stack{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    .output{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px dashed #e9e9e9;min-height:100px}
    .muted-note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    .faq{margin-top:18px}
    footer{margin-top:24px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    /* small responsive */
    @media (max-width:920px){main{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.brand .logo{width:52px;height:52px}}
    /* decorative svg pattern in the corner */
    .pattern{position:fixed;right:12px;bottom:12px;width:220px;height:220px;opacity:0.08;pointer-events:none}
    .blend-card{border-left:4px solid rgba(122,162,130,0.14);padding:12px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fcfff9)}
    .tiny{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="pattern">
    <!-- referencing local svg asset for subtle texture -->
    <img src="assets/img/pattern.svg" alt="pattern" style="width:100%;height:100%"/>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">A</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div class="tiny">An aromatherapeutic practice in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="blends.html">Blends</a>
        <a href="shop.html">Shop</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Rates</a>
        <a href="about.html">Our Story</a>
        <a href="book.html">Book</a>
        <a class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section>
        <h1>Connect and co-create a simple plan</h1>
        <p class="lead">Book a consult, send a quick note, or try the Session Planner and Blend Builder here to sketch a custom approach that may support your daily ease.</p>

        <div class="card" aria-labelledby="planner-title">
          <h2 id="planner-title">Session Planner</h2>
          <p class="small">A practical tool to assemble a gentle plan. This summary is plain text you can save or paste into an email.</p>

          <div class="stack">
            <label for="clientName">Your name</label>
            <input id="clientName" type="text" placeholder="Your name or initials" />

            <label for="freq">Sessions per month</label>
            <input id="freq" type="number" min="0" value="1" />

            <label>Focus areas (pick up to 3)</label>
            <div class="flex" style="flex-wrap:wrap;">
              <label class="tiny"><input type="checkbox" value="Calm" class="goal"> Calm</label>
              <label class="tiny"><input type="checkbox" value="Sleep" class="goal"> Sleep</label>
              <label class="tiny"><input type="checkbox" value="Focus" class="goal"> Focus</label>
              <label class="tiny"><input type="checkbox" value="Energy" class="goal"> Energy</label>
              <label class="tiny"><input type="checkbox" value="Grounding" class="goal"> Grounding</label>
              <label class="tiny"><input type="checkbox" value="Warming" class="goal"> Warming</label>
            </div>

            <label for="notes">Any preferences or cautions</label>
            <textarea id="notes" rows="3" placeholder="Essential oil likes/dislikes, pregnancy, pets, skin sensitivity"></textarea>

            <div class="flex" style="justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:8px">
              <div class="tiny muted-note">All suggestions are non-medical. A patch test is recommended.</div>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px">
                <button id="buildPlan">Build plan</button>
                <button id="emailPlan" style="background:#fff;color:var(--accent);border:1px solid #e1e1e1">Email draft</button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <label for="planOut">Plan summary</label>
            <div id="planOut" class="output" aria-live="polite">Your personalized plan will appear here.</div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px;align-items:center">
              <button id="copyPlan">Copy summary</button>
              <div class="tiny muted-note">Use this summary to save or paste into a message when you book.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:14px">
          <h2>Get in touch</h2>
          <p class="small">Call or write to schedule: <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong> • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
          <form id="contactForm" onsubmit="return false;">
            <label for="cName">Name</label>
            <input id="cName" type="text" required />
            <label for="cEmail">Email</label>
            <input id="cEmail" type="text" required />
            <label for="cMessage">Message</label>
            <textarea id="cMessage" rows="3"></textarea>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px">
              <button id="sendBtn">Send message</button>
              <button id="bookBtn" style="background:#fff;color:var(--accent);border:1px solid #e1e1e1">Request a booking</button>
            </div>
          </form>
        </div>

        <div class="faq card" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
          <h3 id="faq-title">Safety notes & FAQ</h3>
          <ul>
            <li class="small">Dilution: suggested ranges are listed with the Blend Builder. These are conservative, approximate guides for adults and intended for non-medical aromatic support.</li>
            <li class="small">Patch test: always patch test a blend on a small area of skin and wait 24 hours before broader use.</li>
            <li class="small">Pregnancy & nursing: some essential oils are best avoided or used at reduced dilutions. Please mention pregnancy when booking; we will recommend pregnancy-safe options and suggest you consult your healthcare provider.</li>
            <li class="small">Pets: many essential oils are not safe for companion animals. Keep blends out of reach, avoid direct application to pets, and let us help choose pet-safe approaches.</li>
            <li class="small">Children: use much lower dilutions for children and consult a pediatric provider if unsure.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </section>

      <aside>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Blend Builder — quick draft</h3>
          <p class="small">Choose a vibe to see a sample blend card and a safe dilution guide. This is a creative starting point — non-medical, non-prescriptive.</p>

          <label for="vibe">Desired vibe</label>
          <select id="vibe">
            <option value="Calm">Calm & Soothing</option>
            <option value="Focus">Clarity & Focus</option>
            <option value="Sleep">Evening Ease</option>
            <option value="Uplift">Uplift & Brighten</option>
            <option value="Grounding">Grounding & Rooted</option>
          </select>

          <label for="bottle">Bottle size (ml)</label>
          <select id="bottle">
            <option value="10">10 ml</option>
            <option value="15">15 ml</option>
            <option value="30">30 ml</option>
          </select>

          <label for="carrier">Carrier oil (for topical)</label>
          <select id="carrier">
            <option>Fractionated coconut oil</option>
            <option>Sweet almond oil</option>
            <option>Jojoba</option>
            <option>Grapeseed</option>
          </select>

          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px">
            <button id="buildBlend">Make blend</button>
            <button id="copyBlend" style="background:#fff;color:var(--accent);border:1px solid #e1e1e1">Copy card</button>
          </div>

          <div id="blendOut" class="blend-card" style="margin-top:12px">
            Pick a vibe and press "Make blend" to see a sample blend card and dilution.
          </div>

          <div class="tiny muted-note" style="margin-top:8px">Notes: suggested drop counts are approximations using 20 drops = 1 ml. Keep to conservative dilutions. Always patch test.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:14px">
          <h4>Quick contact</h4>
          <p class="small">Prefer direct booking? Click below.</p>
          <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" class="cta" style="display:inline-block">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <div class="small">Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
        <div class="small">© <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — an aromatic approach that may support daily well-being.</div>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    // small utilities
    function $(sel){return document.querySelector(sel)}
    function $all(sel){return Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(sel))}

    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

    // Session Planner
    document.getElementById('buildPlan').addEventListener('click', function(){
      const name = $('#clientName').value.trim() || 'Client';
      const freq = Math.max(0, parseInt($('#freq').value) || 0);
      const goals = $all('.goal:checked').map(cb=>cb.value).slice(0,3);
      const notes = $('#notes').value.trim();

      const recs = [];
      if(goals.length===0) recs.push('Focus: general balance sessions to explore preferences.');
      else recs.push('Focus: ' + goals.join(', ')+'.');
      recs.push('Sessions per month: ' + freq + ' (adjust as needed).');
      if(notes) recs.push('Preferences / cautions: ' + notes);
      recs.push('Suggested starting format: a 60-minute in-person or remote session with a short home blend and a micro-habit to practice between visits.');
      recs.push('\nSafety: suggestions are non-medical, follow a patch test, and mention pregnancy or pets in booking.');

      const out = ['Personalized Session Plan — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}','---',
                   'Name: ' + name,
                   'Date: ' + new Date().toLocaleDateString(),
                   '',
                   ...recs].join('\n');

      $('#planOut').textContent = out;
    });

    document.getElementById('copyPlan').addEventListener('click', async function(){
      const text = $('#planOut').textContent;
      try{ await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text); alert('Plan copied to clipboard');}catch(e){prompt('Copy the text below', text)}
    });

    // Quick email draft
    document.getElementById('emailPlan').addEventListener('click', function(){
      const summary = $('#planOut').textContent || 'Please build a plan first.';
      const subject = encodeURIComponent('Session Plan — ' + ($('#clientName').value || 'client'));
      const body = encodeURIComponent(summary + '\n\nI would like to request availability and next steps.');
      window.location.href = 'mailto:{{EMAIL}}?subject=' + subject + '&body=' + body;
    });

    // Contact form small behavior (local only)
    document.getElementById('sendBtn').addEventListener('click', function(){
      const name = $('#cName').value.trim();
      const email = $('#cEmail').value.trim();
      const message = $('#cMessage').value.trim();
      if(!name||!email){alert('Please enter your name and email.');return}
      // This is a local demo — show a prepared email draft
      const subject = encodeURIComponent('Contact from ' + name);
      const body = encodeURIComponent(message + '\n\nContact: ' + name + ' — ' + email);
      window.location.href = 'mailto:{{EMAIL}}?subject=' + subject + '&body=' + body;
    });

    document.getElementById('bookBtn').addEventListener('click', function(){
      window.location.href = 'book.html';
    });

    // Blend Builder
    const blendProfiles = {
      'Calm': {notes:['Lavender (gentle) 40%','Sweet Orange (bright) 30%','Roman Chamomile (soft) 30%'],advice:'A low dilution suits topical or a diffuser. Use lower dilutions near sensitive skin.'},
      'Focus': {notes:['Rosemary 40%','Lemon 35%','Basil 25%'],advice:'Diffuse briefly during focused work; topical use at low dilution may be suitable.'},
      'Sleep': {notes:['Lavender 50%','Cedarwood 30%','Bergamot (non-photo) 20%'],advice:'Evening blends can be gentle and minimal—consider 0.5–2% topical dilutions for adults.'},
      'Uplift': {notes:['Sweet Orange 50%','Grapefruit 30%','Bergamot (non-photo) 20%'],advice:'Bright citrus top-notes for an uplifting diffuser blend.'},
      'Grounding': {notes:['Vetiver 40%','Frankincense 35%','Patchouli 25%'],advice:'Earthy bases in small, mindful dilutions. Consider inhalation or brief topical use.'}
    };

    function dropsForVolume(ml){
      // conservative estimate: 20 drops = 1 ml
      return Math.round(ml * 20);
    }

    function makeBlendCard(vibe, bottleMl, carrier){
      const profile = blendProfiles[vibe];
      const totalDrops = dropsForVolume(bottleMl);
      // safe dilution suggestions
      const suggestions = [ {label:'Very low (0.5%)',pct:0.5},{label:'Low (1%)',pct:1},{label:'Moderate (2%)',pct:2} ];
      // compute drops per dilution
      const dilutions = suggestions.map(s => {
        const eoDrops = Math.max(1, Math.round(totalDrops * (s.pct/100)));
        return {label:s.label,pct:s.pct,drops:eoDrops};
      });

      // split proportions to drops roughly
      const parts = profile.notes.map(n => n);

      const card = [];
      card.push(vibe + ' blend (sample) — non-medical');
      card.push('Bottle: ' + bottleMl + ' ml | Carrier: ' + carrier);
      card.push('Profile: ' + profile.notes.join(' • '));
      card.push('');
      card.push('Dilution guidance (adult, approximate):');
      dilutions.forEach(d=> card.push('- ' + d.label + ': ~' + d.drops + ' drops total essential oils in the bottle (' + d.pct + '%).'));
      card.push('');
      card.push('Suggested micro-blend (proportional):');
      // propose distribution of drops across notes for the chosen moderate dilution (1% as default for sample)
      const samplePct = 1;
      const sampleDrops = Math.max(1, Math.round(totalDrops * (samplePct/100)));
      // divide sampleDrops proportionally by given percentages in notes if parseable, else equal split
      const parsed = profile.notes.map(n=>{
        const m = n.match(/([\d]{1,3})%/);
        return m?parseInt(m[1],10):null;
      });
      let dropCounts = [];
      if(parsed.every(p=>p)){
        const totalPercent = parsed.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0);
        dropCounts = parsed.map(p=>Math.max(1,Math.round(sampleDrops * (p/totalPercent))));
      } else {
        const each = Math.max(1,Math.round(sampleDrops / profile.notes.length));
        dropCounts = Array(profile.notes.length).fill(each);
      }

      profile.notes.forEach((n,i)=>{
        card.push('- ' + n + ': ' + dropCounts[i] + ' drops');
      });
      card.push('');
      card.push('How to use: add the essential oil drops to the carrier then decant into the bottle. For inhalation, add a few drops to a diffuser pad.');
      card.push('Safety note: Patch test before broader use. Avoid use on or near pets and consult for pregnancy or medical conditions.');
      card.push('Advisor: This is a creative draft. Book a consult to refine a blend tailored to you.');

      return card.join('\n');
    }

    document.getElementById('buildBlend').addEventListener('click', function(){
      const vibe = $('#vibe').value;
      const bottle = parseInt($('#bottle').value,10);
      const carrier = $('#carrier').value;
      const cardText = makeBlendCard(vibe, bottle, carrier);
      $('#blendOut').textContent = cardText;
    });

    document.getElementById('copyBlend').addEventListener('click', async function(){
      const text = $('#blendOut').textContent;
      if(!text||text.startsWith('Pick a vibe')){alert('Make a blend first');return}
      try{ await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text); alert('Blend card copied'); }catch(e){ prompt('Copy blend card', text); }
    });

    // Accessibility small enhancement: allow Enter on certain fields
    ['clientName','freq'].forEach(id=>{ document.getElementById(id).addEventListener('keydown', function(e){ if(e.key==='Enter'){ e.preventDefault(); document.getElementById('buildPlan').click(); } }); });

  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"# Contact — aromatherapy-MORE-2026-02-17T13-11-52-064Z-003

This chunk contains the contact page and documentation for an aromatherapy practice site using the "aura_editorial" layout family and a minimal-poetic voice.

Files included in this bundle:
- contact.html — the main contact & interactive utilities page
- README.md — this file

Purpose
- Provide a contact landing page with tools visitors can use to sketch a plan and a blend before they book.
- Include two local interactive features: a Session Planner and a Blend Builder. Both produce plain-text summaries that can be copied and pasted into an email or saved.

Placeholders
- The HTML uses placeholders that should be replaced at build or runtime:
  - {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
  - {{TAGLINE}}
  - {{PHONE}}
  - {{EMAIL}}
  - {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
  - {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
  - {{CITY}}
  - {{STATE}}

Interactive features (local only)
- Session Planner
  - Inputs: name, sessions per month, up to 3 focus areas, preferences/cautions.
  - Output: a plaintext plan summary that can be copied or opened in an email draft.
  - Intended for planning; not a clinical tool.

- Blend Builder
  - Inputs: desired vibe, bottle size, carrier oil.
  - Output: a sample "blend card" (non-medical) with conservative dilution guidance and approximate drops. Uses 20 drops = 1 ml for drop calculations.
  - Copy button exports the blend card as plaintext.

Safety guidance
- The site uses safety-forward language only and avoids medical claims. The contact page FAQ includes reminders about patch tests, pregnancy considerations, pets, and child safety.
- Dilution guidance is conservative and approximate. Users are advised to patch test, consult professionals as needed, and avoid direct application to pets.

Design notes
- No external assets are loaded; an SVG pattern is referenced at assets/img/pattern.svg (create a unique pattern file for the project).
- Navigation uses a different label set: Home, Offerings, Blends, Shop, Rates, Our Story, Book, Connect.
- The page is responsive and intentionally minimal-poetic in tone.

How to use locally
1. Place this file alongside the rest of the site files (index.html, services.html, blends.html, shop.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html) in a web root.
2. Ensure assets/img/pattern.svg exists (a subtle decorative SVG pattern).
3. Open contact.html in a browser. The interactive widgets run purely client-side (no server required).

Accessibility & progressive enhancement
- Buttons and inputs are standard HTML elements. Copy actions use the Clipboard API with a prompt fallback.

Notes for developers
- The blend drop math uses a simple approximation: dropsPerMl = 20. Adjust if your dropper has a different yield.
- The Session Planner produces plain text suitable for copy/paste or mailto: drafts.
- Replace placeholders with actual business values prior to publishing.

License & disclaimers
- This project contains creative draft content and front-end tooling for an aromatherapy practice. It is not medical advice. All aromatic suggestions are non-medical and use "may support" framing.

